abstract: >-
  Terrain generation, authoring and preprocessing sidecar for a Godot-based
  lunar robotics simulation, focused on the lunar south pole with a real solar
  ephemeris. It is not the physics engine: it produces terrain from real
  LOLA/PGDA digital elevation models plus literature-anchored crater and rock
  populations, with deterministic byte-identical reproduction; Godot remains
  the simulation authority.
keywords:
  - lunar terrain
  - digital elevation model
  - LOLA
  - solar ephemeris
  - permanently shadowed regions
  - robotics simulation
  - Godot
  - procedural generation
  - reproducibility
